{"nonce": "e9a5ed90e352721be53c816c3ce6597af367a17b09ec8d7f2651709c4d599874", "plaintext": "For weeks no one had touched the piano in the empty hall. They sent me to open the hall for the piano tuner. He set his bag on the floor and lifted the lid. One key made a dry little rattle each time he struck it. A green marble lay in a fold of yellow paper inside. He rubbed the dust off with his sleeve and smiled. Then he told me he had lost it there as a boy. I never saw anyone so pleased to finish a small repair. I was glad to be there.", "normalized": "", "groups": {"A": ["2", "k", "a", "v", "e"], "B": ["5"], "C": ["O"], "D": ["J", "X", "W"], "E": ["T", "3", "E", "F", "n", "r", "h", "u", "G", "Z"], "F": ["d", "7"], "G": ["0"], "H": ["p", "o", "z", "C", "g"], "I": ["9", "x", "D", "s"], "K": ["H"], "L": ["t", "M", "B", "K"], "M": ["w"], "N": ["L", "q", "6", "V"], "O": ["4", "b", "i", "P"], "P": ["j"], "R": ["@", "1", "l"], "S": ["S", "y", "f"], "T": ["R", "8", "Y", "N", "m", "I"], "U": ["A"], "V": ["U"], "W": ["c"], "Y": ["Q"]}, "reading_coordinates_zero_based": [[0, 0], [9, 1], [8, 2], [7, 3], [6, 4], [5, 5], [4, 6], [3, 7], [2, 8], [1, 9], [0, 10], [9, 11], [8, 12], [7, 13], [6, 14], [5, 15], [4, 16], [3, 0], [2, 1], [1, 2], [0, 3], [9, 4], [8, 5], [7, 6], [6, 7], [5, 8], [4, 9], [3, 10], [2, 11], [1, 12], [0, 13], [9, 14], [8, 15], [7, 16], [6, 0], [5, 1], [4, 2], [3, 3], [2, 4], [1, 5], [0, 6], [9, 7], [8, 8], [7, 9], [6, 10], [5, 11], [4, 12], [3, 13], [2, 14], [1, 15], [0, 16], [9, 0], [8, 1], [7, 2], [6, 3], [5, 4], [4, 5], [3, 6], [2, 7], [1, 8], [0, 9], [9, 10], [8, 11], [7, 12], [6, 13], [5, 14], [4, 15], [3, 16], [2, 0], [1, 1], [0, 2], [9, 3], [8, 4], [7, 5], [6, 6], [5, 7], [4, 8], [3, 9], [2, 10], [1, 11], [0, 12], [9, 13], [8, 14], [7, 15], [6, 16], [5, 0], [4, 1], [3, 2], [2, 3], [1, 4], [0, 5], [9, 6], [8, 7], [7, 8], [6, 9], [5, 10], [4, 11], [3, 12], [2, 13], [1, 14], [0, 15], [9, 16], [8, 0], [7, 1], [6, 2], [5, 3], [4, 4], [3, 5], [2, 6], [1, 7], [0, 8